# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TMNet — .gitignore
# Patient data, model weights and generated outputs must never be committed.
# Rule order matters: negations must come AFTER the broad exclusion patterns.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- Model weights (never distributed) ----
*.pth
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.onnx
*.pb
*.tflite
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.model
*.weights
*.joblib
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.sav
checkpoint*.pth

# ---- Everything under data/ is excluded ... ----
data/*
!data/example/
!data/expected_output/
!data/generate_demo_data.py

# ---- ... including all data-like file types ... ----
*.dcm
*.dicom
DICOM/
*.nii
*.nii.gz
*.nrrd
*.mha
*.mhd
*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.rds
*.RData
*.h5ad
*.loom
*.svs
*.tif
features/
outputs/
results/
predictions/
runs/

# ---- ... except the simulated demo dataset and the demo output (small csv files) ----
!data/example/*.csv
!data/example/**/*.csv
!data/expected_output/**/*.csv
!data/expected_output/**/*.json

# ---- Logs, caches, temporary ----
.runtime/
logs/
*.log
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp

# ---- Environments ----
.venv/
venv/
env/
.conda/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

# ---- Editors / OS ----
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---- Internal working notes (not for publication) ----
_INTERNAL*
脚本对照表.md
